        "summary": "KnowledgeBoundary accepts a caller-owned mutable learning_map_reference whose equality reports canonical. TrainingContext copies this object into its new KnowledgeBoundary rather than storing an independent canonical immutable LearningMapReference; mutating the source later changes the stored historical reference. Public direct-constructor regression coverage does not include this case."
      },
