        "id": "FINDING-TRAINING-CORE-POST-001-003",
        "file": "src/price_action_learning/training/core.py",
        "line": 138,
        "summary": "Public TrainingAttempt construction validates only Stage equality. It accepts and retains a mutable duck-typed context and mutable user_analysis, and accepts non-null image_reference, arbitrary revision/status, and caller-chosen ID/timestamp. The nested context and analysis can change after construction, violating the immutable submission record and shared TrainingAttempt contract; direct-constructor tests cover Stage only."
      }
    ],
    "reproduction": [
      "A mutable object with __eq__ returning True supplied as learning_map_reference via a boundary source is retained by TrainingContext; changing its value after construction changes context.knowledge_boundary.learning_map_reference.value.",
      "TrainingAttempt constructed with SimpleNamespace context and list user_analysis accepts image_reference=\"screenshot\", revision=\"revised\", status=\"OTHER\"; subsequent source mutation changes the stored context Stage and analysis list."
